      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Heavily upvoted this with the stipulation to add \"badge must be shown\" option as well. \n\nBadge must be shown: prior to joining instance, you must have the 18+ badge shown to enter. Within instance, it cannot be removed. If attempting to remove the badge within instance, it will warn the player. Confirmation of removing the badge will result in them being kicked from the instance.\n\nThis addition would solve a few things. It would reduce the amount of verified adult trolls, potentially pretending that the system doesn't work. Also, it would increase confidence of the instance by standardizing the requirement to have the badge shown, further incentivizing people to stay identifiable. Lastly, it would reduce the necessity for checking someone's profile out if, with high confidence, everyone joining definitely has the badge.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-12-27T18:22:28.229Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Additional Group permission for ID/Age Verified with seperation of the \"18+\" and \"Age verified\"\n\nMy example is \"@Everyone\"\n\nThese are normally new users to the group with zero permisisons\n\nI suggest that another role for users that have the \"18+\" or Age verified tags on their account.\n\nThis allows new users to the group or anywhere in the future who are 18+ or Age verified to jump straght in to group activitys without needing to undergo some process.\n\n(Images attached are inspect edit made for example)",
